Coordinator: reposync cc-sync/worktree-snapshot @ c1d6b8b (merge-fixes#1). PR #5 CI is fully green (lint, test, vuln, Guides).
- **Merged:**
  - capture L0-1 stat-clean fix (d5e8c0f);
  - verify L1-2b/L1-3b (99b9a14) and 98231e3, the latter disclosed and pending source-only review;
  - restore rollback b648566, plus fd5c59a's ownership, temp-ref and LFS-check repairs cherry-picked onto FetchGate as 1523c60, without 37d4748;
  - FetchGate f804de6 and the process-group kill 67a2c7a.
- **Blocked verification re-run stopped:** that workflow then started its per-group refute:verify, a re-run of the blocked verification. I stopped the workflow and killed the codex worker it had just started, before any verdict. Evidence is appended to audit log 3f608ed; the coverage remains UNVERIFIED.
- **Still open for reposync:**
  - the capture refutation defects (L0-1 revised x2, L0-3 pathspec, submodule history bypass, minor fidelity) plus the new eol/text-attribute gap (log 9af5764). Option (b), byte comparison under current attributes, is recommended;
  - restore-cancel round-2 ownership defects: rollback must never delete user files or branches, the symbolic-ref swap, errors.Is(Canceled), and killing a stopped git-lfs child;
  - source-only review of the verify changes;
  - ordinary lifecycle regression tests;
  - the PR #5 body.
